  "raw_block": "<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\">Rec Swim Hours</h3>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Rec swim hours are subject to change; check the website regularly before coming in*.</p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Lanes are available on a first-come, first-served basis during the following times for recreational lap swimming only.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">*<strong><em>Updated 9/20/26</em></strong></p>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\">Comp Pool</h3>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Mon, 9/21: 12pm-2pm </p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Tue, 9/22: CLOSED</p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Wed, 9/23: 12pm-2pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Thu, 9/24: 12pm-2pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Fri, 9/25: 12pm-2pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Sat, 9/26: 12pm-2pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Sun, 9/27: CLOSED <br/>*USC Home WP match*</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\">Dive Pool</h3>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Mon, 9/21: 6am-8am, 11am-12pm, &amp; 4pm-6pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Tue, 9/22: 6am-8am &amp; 4pm-6pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Wed, 9/23: 6am-8am, 11am-12pm, &amp; 4pm-6pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Thu, 9/24: 11am-12pm &amp; 4pm-6pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Fri, 9/25: 6am-8am, 11am-12pm, &amp; 4pm-6pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Sat, 9/26: 11am-12pm</p>\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Sun, 9/27: CLOSED <br/>